OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds killed or injured by drug
OL,4,Adrivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty people have been killed and 180
OL,7,Fseriously injured in West Yorkshire in
OL,8,Fthe past five years because of drug
OL,9,Fdriving, according to new figures.
OL,11,FThe data shared by the West Yorkshire
OL,12,FCombined Authority (WYCA) also revealed
OL,13,Fthere had been more than 800 drug
OL,14,Fdriving arrests in the last 12 months
OL,15,Falone.
OL,17,FCarol Coleman, whose son Dean Miles,
OL,18,F49, died after he was hit by a driver
OL,19,Fwho was over the legal limit for
OL,20,Fcannabis, said the statistics were
OL,21,F"shocking" and called for more to be
OL,22,Fdone to highlight the dangers.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
