OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds killed or injured by drug
OL,4,Adrivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as a campaign was launched by
OL,7,FWYCA and the Department for Transport
OL,8,Fseeking to raise awareness of the risks
OL,9,Fof driving under the influence of
OL,10,Fdrugs.
